     "body": "<p><b>Update:</b></p>\n\n<p>It is reproducible IF we first apply the filter.</p>\n\n\n<p>Then we copy the link from the URL bar and then open that customized URL after applying the filter in the mobile view.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for reporting this <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" data-account-id=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" accountid=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bilal Muzamil</a> </p>\n\n<p>cc: <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" data-account-id=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" accountid=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Dusan Radulovic</a> </p>",
